   player 的 .bg 与 qt-page-frame 壁纸都踩过同一个坑）。 */
.wide-feature { position: relative; padding: 24px; min-height: 180px; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
.wide-feature-bg { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 0; }
